# Every stage of apps/api/Dockerfile COPYs specific paths, never the whole
# context - but the context itself is still packed and sent to the builder
# in full first (this is what railway up's "Uploading..." step does), so an
# unfiltered node_modules or local venv here means a slow, multi-hundred-MB
# upload of files no COPY instruction ever reads. Excluded here instead.
node_modules
**/node_modules
apps/web/dist
apps/api/.venv-check
.devtools
.git
